{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Remember</strong></i> when hitting a glitchy TV actually fixed it? <i>Breaking News</i> is an award-winning comedy adventure where the TV is the controller. Smack the CRT to shake up the broadcast and twist the story to fit your uncle's crazy conspiracy theories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/ec46de1e0f9074412c88eb8f8b5889e1.poster.avif?t=1769288688\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/ec46de1e0f9074412c88eb8f8b5889e1.webm?t=1769288688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/ec46de1e0f9074412c88eb8f8b5889e1.mp4?t=1769288688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the TV from the right, left or top to manipulate the channel differently. You might:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch  a NASA shuttle<strong>\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">or sabotage it and blame it on the communists</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prevent the Leaning Tower of Pisa from collapsing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide the fate of a high profile police chase</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspire a struggling artist to paint a masterpiece </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/f6021f45e4286f8078e5754f10ffa766.poster.avif?t=1769288688\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/f6021f45e4286f8078e5754f10ffa766.webm?t=1769288688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/f6021f45e4286f8078e5754f10ffa766.mp4?t=1769288688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Channel surf the 90s:</strong> packed with unique game-mechanics inspired by the golden age of television.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices Matter: </strong>Your hits  shape how each absurd scenario plays out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable: </strong>Challenge yourself to uncover every gag, conspiracy and secret ending. It's better than binging Friends for the 10th time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No heavy lifting:</strong>\u00a0CRT gaming without    driving 3 hours to buy a\u00a0200lb TV from a sketchy guy on Craigslist. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/35ae47617fcfe387edd7b50b7e62b49e.poster.avif?t=1769288688\" width=600 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/35ae47617fcfe387edd7b50b7e62b49e.webm?t=1769288688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3541940/extras/35ae47617fcfe387edd7b50b7e62b49e.mp4?t=1769288688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> DISCLAIMER:\u00a0</strong>NO TVs WERE HARMED IN THE MAKING OF THIS GAME.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(ok, maybe just one. You might have heard about the alternative-controller version of the game, where we modified an actual CRT TV to react to the player's hits)  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"b